      "blurb": "Earth Release: Mud Wolf",
      "summonRole": "Mud Wolf",
      "biography": "<p><em>Earth Release: Mud Wolf (C-Rank, concentration up to 1 minute).</em> Two wolves (+1 per rank above C); Earthen Artifacts. They use your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC; you command them all as a Bonus Action.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 12 + your Ninjutsu ability modifier · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 25 + 10 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +1 (save +3), DEX +1 (save +3), CON +1 (save +5), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Acid, Poison, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC from your Ninjutsu modifier, hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
